                                "sense_id": "4ca44a56-777e-3420-b4c5-32105ceb4b07",
                                "text": "And lastly, the examinant saith, that from the beginning of these conversations with the said Mary Burton, about these plottings and caballings between the Hughsons and the negroes […]"
